# Pine & River Community Trust

PROG2002 Assessment 2. Public site for charity events in Brisbane.

Two Node apps live side by side:

- `server` — Express + MySQL, GET only
- `website` — static pages on a small Express host

## Setup

Import `server/sql/charityevents_db.sql` in MySQL Workbench.

Edit `server/event_db.js` so the user and password match your MySQL login.

```bash
cd server
npm install
npm start
```

API: http://localhost:3002

```bash
cd website
npm install
npm start
```

Website: http://localhost:3003

Keep both processes running.

## Endpoints

- `GET /api/events` — current and upcoming public events
- `GET /api/events/search?date=&location=&category=` — optional filters; past events allowed
- `GET /api/events/:id` — one event; paused rows return 404
- `GET /api/categories` — filter options
